	"macros": [
		{"name":"DeclareNewFootnote","args":[{"kind":"o","placeholder":"footnote style"},{"kind":"m","placeholder":"suffix","defines":"new","derives":[{"role":"macro","name":"footnote{}","makes":{"args":[{"kind":"o"},{"kind":"m","role":"text","part":"footnote"}]}},{"role":"macro","name":"footnotetext{}","makes":{"args":[{"kind":"o"},{"kind":"m","role":"text","part":"footnote"}]}},{"role":"macro","name":"Footnote{}","makes":{"args":[{"kind":"o"},{"kind":"m","role":"text","part":"footnote"}]}},{"role":"macro","name":"Footnotetext{}","makes":{"args":[{"kind":"o"},{"kind":"m","role":"text","part":"footnote"}]}},{"role":"macro","name":"footnotemark{}","makes":{"args":[{"kind":"o"}]}},{"role":"macro","name":"Footnotemark{}","makes":{"args":[{"kind":"o"}]}},{"role":"macro","name":"thefootnote{}","makes":{"args":[]}},{"role":"macro","name":"footins{}","makes":{"args":[]}},{"role":"counter","name":"footnote{}"}]},{"kind":"o","placeholder":"enumeration style"}],"doc":"Service command \\DeclareNewFootnote simplifies creation of new footnote levels with automatic footnote numbering."},
